---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import WhyDView from '../components/WhyDView.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About D-VIEW Solutions | Balcony Safety Engineering"
  description="D-VIEW Solutions specializes in stainless steel invisible safety grills, operating in Bengaluru with regional expansion planning for Andhra Pradesh."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.dviewsolutions.com/about"
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-xs font-semibold text-[#16A34A] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          <span>Our Story & Metallurgy Ethos</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight break-words">
          ARCHITECTURAL SAFETY. <br />
          <span class="text-[#16A34A]">UNCOMPROMISED VISTAS.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          We founded D-VIEW Solutions with a single unwavering conviction: modern high-rise homeowners should never have to sacrifice their hard-earned panoramic horizons to keep their families safe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-none text-slate-700 space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-16">
        <p>
          Across urban residential corridors—from our established operations in Bengaluru to planned regional expansion across Andhra Pradesh—modern apartments have often been enclosed in heavy, rusting iron bars. Beyond the aesthetic penalty, traditional welded iron poses severe safety and egress challenges during emergencies.
        </p>
        <p>
          D-VIEW provides a precision-engineered alternative: multi-strand stainless steel wire cables (offering both SS-316 and SS-304 options based on site requirements) anchored into structural concrete with heavy-duty aluminum tracks. Designed for reliable balcony containment and fall deterrence, our invisible grills provide safety while preserving open vistas against the skyline.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <WhyDView />
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
